  "html": "<article data-article-id=\"6fb626a6-774a-43be-8268-918f4adcaffc\">\n  <p class=\"poem\">You say you are free;<br>Yet you are bound<br>To pleasure,<br>To hate,<br>To the opinions of your peers.</p>\n  <p class=\"poem\">I say I am bound;<br>Yet I am free<br>For service,<br>For love,<br>For submission to the will of my God.</p>\n  <p class=\"poem\">And in this my bound liberty,<br>I am far more free<br>Than you are<br>In your liberated bondage.</p>\n</article>\n",
